OL,3,GNEWSARapist who fled UK before trial
OL,4,Ajailed in absence
OL,5,
OL,6,FA rapist who fled the country before he
OL,7,Fcould go on trial has been jailed in
OL,8,Fhis absence for 18 years.
OL,10,FAadel Nassrallah, 39, ran away to Syria
OL,11,Fbefore he could face justice, Newcastle
OL,12,FCrown Court heard.
OL,14,FA trial was held in his absence and he
OL,15,Fwas found guilty of offences including
OL,16,Frape.
OL,18,FThe victim said Nassrallah, who had
OL,19,Flived in Elswick in Newcastle, "took
OL,20,Fthe joy" out of her life.
